# Google OAuth — template (safe to commit)

Copy to `secrets/google-oauth.local.md` (gitignored) and fill real values from
Google Cloud → Credentials → OAuth client JSON download.

Project id example: `cosy-ai-oauth`

## Paste into Lovable/Supabase → Authentication → Providers → Google

- **Client ID:** `YOUR_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com`
- **Client Secret:** `YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET`

## Google Cloud must have

Redirect URIs (Lovable + Supabase):

```
https://oauth.lovable.app/callback
https://cosy-app-kit.lovable.app/~oauth/callback
https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
```

JS origins (examples):

```
https://cosy-app-kit.lovable.app
http://127.0.0.1:8080
http://localhost:8080
```

## Checklist

1. External audience + Test users (while in Testing mode).
2. Enable Google provider in Supabase/Lovable with Client ID/Secret.
3. `curl -sI "https://YOUR_REF.supabase.co/auth/v1/authorize?provider=google&redirect_to=https://cosy-app-kit.lovable.app/auth"` → expect `302` Location to `accounts.google.com`.
4. Never commit `*.local.md` or the Google `client_secret_*.json`.
